<title>NEW ZEALAND: FCL Forests 1st half profit falls.</title>
<headline>FCL Forests 1st half profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				    37 vs 48</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				  4.6 vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  3.0 vs same</p>
<p>    Turnover				     264 vs 202</p>
<p>    Operating earnings			  36 vs 63</p>
<p>    Tax						7 vs 10</p>
<p>Dividend carries 1.48 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date April 2</p>
<p>Reg date March 14</p>
<p>Note - Fletcher Forests is the forest plantation division Fletcher Challenge Ltd. Market expectations were for a net profit of NZ$25-35 million. Net profit included interest income on an advance to CNI Forest Partnership of NZ$7.0 million. From August 21 to December 31, CNI Forest Partnership's net earnings came to NZ$26 million.  </p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
